# For Debugging

    ## List partitions / filesystems
    virt-filesystems -a /path/to/disk.vdi --all --long

    ## Mount .vdi file with guestmount
    guestmount -a /path/to/disk.vdi -m /dev/sda1 --rw /tmp/vdi-mount

    ## Unmount
    guestunmount ~/vdi-mount